#: plasmoid/contents/ui/logic.js
msgid "You held %1 after these updates were prepared, so it still installs. Discard them and install again to skip it."
msgstr "Vous avez retenu %1 après la préparation de ces mises à jour, elle s'installe donc quand même. Abandonnez-les et réinstallez pour l'ignorer."

#: plasmoid/contents/ui/logic.js
msgid "You held %2 and 1 more after these updates were prepared, so they still install. Discard them and install again to skip them."
